Subject: [PATCH] media: camss: quiesce the owned X1E RDI pipeline

Drain programmed buffers without refilling. Stop the owned write master,
acknowledge a fresh CSID reset and synchronize IRQs before DMA release.
Keep acquired resources and DMA mappings on failed teardown. Qualification
is limited to a matched CSID/VFE and one RDI MMAP owner.

---
